          "name_loc": "Ahead, Armageddon",
          "desc_loc": "For each second Chaos Knight keeps moving without stopping or attacking, Armageddon gains bonus movement speed. The bonus drains away while stopping, and lost when attacking.<br><br>While at least one of Chaos Knight's phantasms is alive, Ahead, Armageddon can be activated to charge over terrain, building up to a max speed before releasing.  Chaos Knight and the illusions will attack units they charge over. Can only be activated once per cast of Phantasm, and is refreshed when Phantasm is cast.",
